Description: Gh0st OS system configuration
 Configuration only: apt sources and pins, what dpkg leaves out, which
 services start, journald off, zram, sysctl, udev rules for the Raspberry Pi
 devices, and NetworkManager privacy defaults. It also pulls in the
 command-line tools a Linux user expects, so a device that updates gets
 them too.
